      "author": "Michael S. Sorensen",
      "category": "Philosophy",
      "type": "concept",
      "headline": "Micro-Invalidations Add Up",
      "body": "Subtle reactions like glancing at your phone, rolling your eyes, or saying 'you're overreacting' act like tiny paper cuts that destroy psychological safety.",
